  <!-- ============================================================
       DERIVED STRUCTURAL GRAPH

       These are not separate "levels".
       They are normal object relations.

       Inheritance answers:
         "What kind of object is this?"

       contains / part-of answers:
         "Where does this object belong?"

       scale answers:
         "At what structural granularity?"

       dimension answers:
         "Which aspect-space does it participate in?"
       ============================================================ -->

